@* The size and layout controls an image embed's toolbar has, whether the image is an artwork's
   or uploaded into the post. ImageEmbedControls.razor.js handles them, and the caption in
   EmbedCaptionField *@
<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
  <div class="flex" role="group" aria-label="Size">
    <EmbedToolbarButton data-size="small" aria-pressed="false">Small</EmbedToolbarButton>
    <EmbedToolbarButton data-size="medium" aria-pressed="false">Medium</EmbedToolbarButton>
  </div>
  <EmbedLayoutButtons CenterLabel="Centre" CenterIcon="center" />
</div>
